.git
.github
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/npm-debug.log
**/.phpunit.result.cache
.gitignore

# Node / frontend junk (SPA is published into public-spa separately)
**/node_modules
modules/**/frontend/node_modules
modules/**/frontend/dist
modules/**/frontend/dist-*
modules/apm/node_modules
modules/apm/whatsapp-service/node_modules

# Composer / vendor (bind-mounted at runtime; prod bake can still use --no-cache if needed)
**/vendor

# Runtime noise
**/storage/logs/*
**/storage/framework/cache/data/*
**/storage/framework/sessions/*
**/storage/framework/views/*
**/storage/debugbar
!**/.gitkeep

# Local env / secrets / backups (never bake)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.env.bak
**/.env.backup
**/setup.env

# Tests / docs / agent noise not needed in image
**/tests
**/phpunit.xml
docs/superpowers
**/.phpunit.cache
**/coverage
**/*.md
!docker/README.md

# Heavy assets not required to build the PHP image
**/public-spa
**/assets
**/*.map
**/.vite
**/dist-build
